      <title>美国司法部支持OpenAI：AI训练使用版权材料属合理使用</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260903/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E9%83%A8%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81OpenAIAI%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%89%88%E6%9D%83%E6%9D%90%E6%96%99%E5%B1%9E%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</link>
